<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57112" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηλίς</span></b> , [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῖδος</span>, ἡ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stain,
				spot, defilement</i>, esp. of blood, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				787
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				446
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				1200
			</span></i>, etc.: generally, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ ῥᾴδιον
				ἐκμάξαι τὴν . . κηλῖδα [ἐκ τοῦ κατόπτρου</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Insomn.</u>
				459b32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἱματίῳ καθαρῷ καὶ αἱ μικραὶ κ.
					ἔνδηλοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>GA</u>
					780b32
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάτιον κηλίδων μεστόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Char.</u>
					19.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>stain, blemish</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1384
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. συμφορᾶς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				833
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>OC</u>
					1134
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐστάθη τὴν ἀσπίδα ἔχων, ὃ δοκεῖ κ.
					εἶναι τοῖς Λακεδαιμονίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					3.1.9
				</span></i>
			; <i>ignominious punishment</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεία κ. προσπίπτει τῷ δράσαντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					3.3.8
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς κ. εἰς ὑμᾶς
			ἀναφερομένης</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμωρίας καὶ κηλῖδας πάσας αὐτοῖς
					ἀνῆκεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					6.8.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Medic.,
				<i>naevus</i>, Lycusap.<i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				9.44.3
			</span></i>.</div>
